          "docs/superpowers/state/chapters/chapter-13.yaml",
          "docs/superpowers/state/overall.yaml"
        ],
        "planned_actions": [
          "Load and validate the current task-local final V2 evidence before V2 CI execution, derive the existing independent verifier binding, and replay its immutable mutation artifact",
          "Keep V2 CI checks read-only with respect to the task directory and prohibit recorder, action-consumption and mutation-runner calls",
          "Evaluate V2 Gate with current local-final review/code-approval facts and independently current external CI checks, mutation replay, verifier/context and attestation facts",
          "Add positive and fail-closed integration coverage while preserving V0/V1 and local V2 behavior",
          "Validate the corrected implementation first with a separately approved full local V2 transaction",
          "After a separate single-use action approval, create one exact OS-temporary local Git worktree at the corrected TASK-0028 H1 code-approval attestation commit",
          "Run CI-mode verification into an exact OS-temporary run directory and evaluate the read-only Gate against that CI evidence; CI must not launch targeted mutation",
          "Record a sanitized task-local CI simulation receipt and update the Chapter 13 implementation narrative, then project only task 13.3 complete and advance to pending 13.4",
          "Reverify the completion projection under a new current-subject V2 action, independent implementation review, code approval and local Gate"
        ]
      }
    ],
